Aspect Interface (Declaration) Implementation (Definition) What What function expects How function works Contains Signature only Full body Changes Rarely Can change freely Client sees Yes No (hidden) <p>Example: <pre><code>// Interface
int f2(int x, int y);

// Implementation A
int f2(int x, int y) { return x + y; }

// Implementation B (same interface)
